  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Color play",
    "overview": "A welcoming shared card table combines a rich blue field, warm cream foreground, vivid native UNO cards and expressive illustrated human portraits. Outfit keeps the interface friendly and direct; Barlow Condensed gives the deck, wordmark and selected game actions their familiar energy. Soft contact shadows and inset press edges make cards and controls feel physical.\n\nThis records the shipped October 24 composite: Classic supplies the blue field and card prominence, Color court supplies the portraits, and After-hours supplies amber turn and action emphasis. The approved direction is `.impeccable/review/experience-reset/contract.md` (FORM seed `2fba311c`); its three references are `reset-classic.png`, `reset-color-court.png` and `reset-after-hours.png` under `.impeccable/mocks/decision/`. No catalog quality-bar world was selected. Earlier Comic-card showdown, giant-cast/painted-menu, violet-corner, illustrated-room and poker-table instructions are historical and superseded. Their assets and provenance remain recoverable; they are not current surface guidance.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Quiet blue or plum preset fields keep attention on live cards and people.",
      "Human portraits, opaque nameplates and exact hand counts make the table social and readable.",
      "Outfit UI and Barlow Condensed deck lettering share one friendly voice.",
      "Amber pressed actions and a compact real countdown explain the current decision.",
